sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant NextApp as Next.js App
    participant NextAuth
    participant OAuth as OAuth Provider (GitHub/Google)
    participant DB as MongoDB

    User->>NextApp: Initiates social login
    NextApp->>NextAuth: Redirects to NextAuth
    NextAuth->>OAuth: Redirects to OAuth provider

    OAuth-->>User: Prompts for login
    User->>OAuth: Provides credentials

    OAuth-->>NextAuth: Returns OAuth token

    NextAuth->>DB: Checks if account exists

    alt Account doesn't exist
        NextAuth->>DB: Creates new Account
        NextAuth->>DB: Creates new User
    else Account exists
        DB-->>NextAuth: Returns existing User
    end

    NextAuth->>NextAuth: Generates session
    NextAuth-->>NextApp: Returns session
